# ValueBet Engine — environment variables
# Copy to .env and fill in. Never commit .env.
# Which variables are actually used is decided by the phase 0 recon
# (see docs/data-sources.md); unused ones are ignored.

# --- API-Football (api-sports.io) ---
# Free tier: fixtures, results, lineups, injuries for top-5 leagues + UCL.
API_FOOTBALL_KEY=

# --- The Odds API (the-oddsapi.com) ---
# Candidate #1 for totals odds. Free tier.
ODDS_API_KEY=

# (Candidate #2 for odds is API-Football odds endpoints — uses API_FOOTBALL_KEY
# above, no separate variable.)

# --- Search APIs for team news ---
# Candidate #1: Tavily. Free tier.
TAVILY_API_KEY=
# Candidate #2: Brave Search API. Free tier. Optional — used only to compare quality.
BRAVE_SEARCH_API_KEY=

# --- Google Gemini ---
# News extraction, justifications, shadow adjustments.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# --- Later phases (not needed for phase 0) ---
# Bearer token for the service REST API (phase 8).
#API_TOKEN=
